PR #62 (fictional, examiner-written) "Posting preview: show the lines, approve or reject with a confirm step"
Author: accounting-integrations-engineer        Base: main        +71 / -9 lines
CI: green (typecheck, lint, tests, build)

Description:
  Friday product pass feedback: the Xero preview is a bare button and controllers can't see the lines.
  This shows the lines, adds a confirm step and a reject flow. Also rounds amounts nicely — the
  controller persona said "too many decimals, looks messy". UI-only change, no logic touched, so it is
  fine for the 06:17 merge gate once reviewed.

diff --git a/src/components/books/ApprovePosting.tsx b/src/components/books/ApprovePosting.tsx
--- a/src/components/books/ApprovePosting.tsx
+++ b/src/components/books/ApprovePosting.tsx
@@ -9,32 +9,94 @@ import { useActor } from "@/components/ActingAs";
